yLightDecomposition","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The heavy–light decomposition of a rooted tree or arborescence: each vertex’s heavy child is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its child with the largest subtree (the first in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"children(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" order on a tie), and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"heavy edges form paths. Vertices get positions in a preorder that takes the heavy child first,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so each heavy path and each subtree is an interval of positions, and any path between two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices is at most 2⌊log₂ n⌋ + 1 intervals ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"segments(from:to:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), for path and subtree"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"queries over a structure indexed by position."}],"title":"HeavyLightDecomposition","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HeavyLightDecomposition","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://TreeAlgorithms/documentation/TreeAlgorithms/HeavyLightDecomposition/Preorder-swift.struct/firstNonNil(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TreeAlgorithms\/documentation\/TreeAlgorithms\/HeavyLightDecomposition\/Preorder-swift.struct\/firstNonNil(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/treealgorithms\/heavylightdecomposition\/preorder-swift.struct\/firstnonnil(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"firstNonNil","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Result","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">((","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Result"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"kind":"